title: Start
---
<<declare $gold = 5>>
<<declare $hasMap = false>>
Narrator: A crossroads at dusk. A Rogue leans on the signpost, twirling a rolled map.
-> Buy the map for 2 gold
    <<if $gold >= 2>>
        <<set $gold = $gold - 2>>
        <<set $hasMap = true>>
        Rogue: Pleasure doing business. The chapel path is due north.
        <<jump Chapel>>
    <<else>>
        Rogue: Come back when your purse is heavier.
    <<endif>>
-> Walk on
    Narrator: You leave the Rogue to the crows.
===

title: Chapel
---
Narrator: The chapel door creaks open on the Rogue's map. Something glints on the altar.
===
